<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετάθεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετατίθημι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change of position,
				transposition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1024a4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταθέσεις ἐξ ἕδρας ἀτόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν ῥημάτων μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.84
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀναβαθμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.546
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐμβρύου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.60
				</span></i>
			; <i>couching</i> of a cataract, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.990
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>change</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς οὐδεμίαν ἐπιδεχόμενος μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					400b29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐκ τῆς οἰκείας φύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.216
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμου μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					7.12
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>change of sides</i> or <i>opinions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ βέλτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.35.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, etc. (hence, <i>amendment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἡμαρτημένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.11
				</span></i>
			. 
			<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μεταθέσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					30.20.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>going over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.86.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>exchange, barter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.1.8
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>change</i> of a letter, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				51.5
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				795.34
			</span></i>; also, <i>metathesis, transposition</i> of letters, as
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδίη</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρδία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Trypho
				<u>Pass.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγλαά</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>plagiarism</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίμησις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				112
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>power</i> or <i>right of changing sides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
